jellyfin-ai/neo4j/import
jellyfin-ai/redis
jellyfin-ai/redis/*
jellyfin-ai/redis/**

# A host node_modules/ must never enter a root-context build. The
# a2ui-renderer builder runs `npm ci` and THEN copies its source tree; an
# on-disk node_modules from a developer's `npm install` would land on top
# of the clean install and ship host-arch binaries into the image. No
# Dockerfile in this repo copies node_modules from a context (only from a
# builder stage via --from=), so excluding it is subtractive only.
**/node_modules
